        "content": "## Engine 3: Multi channel message dispatcher\n\nPurpose:\n1. Delivers message using each restaurant's own WhatsApp account.\n2. If WhatsApp fails, it switches to SMS and Email further, automatically.\n3. Saves the status of message in database.",
